        <cbc:Name languageID="ENG">Events Production and Management Service for Brigid 1500 Programme</cbc:Name>
        <cbc:Description languageID="ENG">Events Production and Management Service for Brigid 1500 Programme. Event management including risk assessment, safety planning, traffic management, promotional events, managing and upholding all health and safety requirements for events to include the following: - 2 outdoor festival of fire events which will be held in towns in Kildare (North and South of County), - Shared Service event in St. Brigid’s Cathedral in Kildare- crowd management, sound and light, recording and streaming of event, - Production and management of 1 large outdoor drone show event with family entertainment in serviced venue in County Kildare to be determined. This will include full event booking, securing all necessary licenses, sourcing entertainment, crowd control, traffic management and health and safety assessments and any other necessary services as required. Events will take place in February 2024 as part of Brigid 1500 St. Brigid's Festival.</cbc:Description>
